# Dependencies
node_modules
features.md

# pi-lens internal
.pi-lens/
.stryker/
reports/
# Probe-home redirect target (#2506): getGlobalPiLensLogDir() sends the logs
# of a probe run without a PI_LENS_HOME pin here instead of the real
# ~/.pi-lens. Untracked by design -- if it were not ignored, every agent
# worktree that ran one probe would stay dirty forever and #2435's aged
# worktree sweep (clean-only) could never reap it.
.pi-lens-probe-home/
.harness/
.pi-subagents/

